  <static seed="258" source="Library/Valdosta/APEX_Calculus/2.7/APEX_2.7_29.pg">
    <statement><p>Find the equation of the line tangent to the graph
of <m>f</m> at the indicated <m>x</m> value.
<me>y = 8 \sin^{-1} 3 x, \quad x = 0</me></p>
<p>Tangent line: <m>y=</m><fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>24x</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert> Solution:</alert> 



Find the derivative: 
<me>\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[ 8 \sin^{-1} 3 x \right] = \frac{24}{\sqrt{1-9*x^2}},</me>
and plug in <m>x = 0</m> to get <m>m = 24</m>.


</solution>
